%% PROPOSED voice-to-editable-transcript lifecycle. Never auto-submits.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> IDLE
  IDLE --> PERMISSION_REQUEST: mic click
  PERMISSION_REQUEST --> RECORDING: granted
  PERMISSION_REQUEST --> PERMISSION_DENIED: NotAllowedError
  PERMISSION_REQUEST --> NO_DEVICE: NotFoundError
  RECORDING --> TRANSCRIBING: stop or 30s cap
  RECORDING --> CANCELLED: cancel, Esc or widget closed
  RECORDING --> CAPTURE_FAILED: recorder error or too large
  TRANSCRIBING --> TRANSCRIPT_READY: text returned
  TRANSCRIBING --> NO_SPEECH: empty text
  TRANSCRIBING --> STT_FAILED: provider error or timeout
  TRANSCRIBING --> SESSION_EXPIRED: 401
  TRANSCRIBING --> CANCELLED: abort
  TRANSCRIPT_READY --> USER_EDITING: user types
  TRANSCRIPT_READY --> RECORDING: re-record
  USER_EDITING --> SUBMITTED: explicit Send
  TRANSCRIPT_READY --> SUBMITTED: explicit Send
  SUBMITTED --> [*]: intent resolution (text path)
  PERMISSION_DENIED --> IDLE
  NO_DEVICE --> IDLE
  CAPTURE_FAILED --> IDLE
  NO_SPEECH --> IDLE
  STT_FAILED --> IDLE
  SESSION_EXPIRED --> IDLE
  CANCELLED --> IDLE
